    <!--
        The legacy "Check Contract Expiry" job used to live here. It ended leases
        without the safeguards of `_cron_expire_leases` (company switch, notice,
        termination in progress, arrears) and overrode them, so it was retired:
        `data/leasing_crons.xml` holds the one lease-expiry job. Removing the
        record deletes it from installed databases on the next module update.
    -->
    <!--
        The two legacy unit-line status jobs ("Update Contract Line Status" here
        and "Contract Line Auto Expiry") are retired too. Units are allocations,
        whose occupancy and blocking follow the lease lifecycle; legacy line
        states no longer drive anything.
    -->

</odoo>